\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The post-prediction patient HMM as a graphical model, with one state per patient and date. Orange circles are the hidden finding states $y_t \in \{0,1\}^{30}$, blue boxes the images and the frozen classifier, white boxes metadata. The transition prior $\pi $ (Eq.~\eqref  {eq:trans}) depends on the previous state, the metadata of the current date and the gap $\Delta _t$; a state without an earlier state uses $\pi ^{0}(m)$ (Eq.~\eqref  {eq:init}). The classifier supplies only the emission (Eq.~\eqref  {eq:emission}), and prior and emission are combined after the network. In the observed mode $y_{t-1}$ is read from the previous report (dashed); in the filtered mode it is inferred from $x_{1:t-1}$ by Eqs.~\eqref  {eq:predict}--\eqref  {eq:update}.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:hmm}{{3}{3}{}{figure.3}{}}
